[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4629333549","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120027#issuecomment-4629333549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120027","id":4629333549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE-4GLQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T07:49:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T09:29:48Z","body":"> Claude Code was used to assist development and to refactor code.\r\n\r\nCould you please be a bit more specific as to the scope of the use?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4629333549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4630650590","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120027#issuecomment-4630650590","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120027","id":4630650590,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFAIe3g","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T10:42:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T10:42:31Z","body":"Thanks! I haven't done a proper code review, but I have some quick high-level thoughts...\r\n\r\nAre spatial pinch events only possible when using `VisionOSXRInterface`? Or, also in flat (non-XR) apps on visionOS?\r\n\r\nIf they are only possible when using `VisionOSXRInterface`, then I think this should be handled through `XRControllerTracker`/`XRController3D` rather than a new `InputEventSpatial` event. The fact that this has 3d ray and pose does make it feel like it could be an `XRControllerTracker`, even if it's one that only \"moves\" when an event happens - there are trackers like that in `WebXRInterface`.\r\n\r\nBut if we do go with a new input event, this is adding `InputEventSpatial` as a platform class (only available on visionOS), but it has a very generic name that doesn't sound a platform class. If we keep this name, we should try to make it cross-platform somehow, otherwise, I think it should get a name that indicates it's visionOS-only.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4630650590/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4635832000","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120027#issuecomment-4635832000","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120027","id":4635832000,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFFEuwA","user":{"login":"rsanchezsaez","id":444313,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NDMxMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/444313?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez","html_url":"https://github.com/rsanchezsaez","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsanchezsaez/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T21:52:05Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T21:52:24Z","body":"Hi, apologies, this was submitted against master by mistake.\r\n\r\n@dsnopek  Thanks for the early thoughts!\r\n\r\nThe PR set that this change is part of are on https://github.com/rsanchezsaez/godot/pulls as stacked PRs over https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109975, to discuss what approach should we take to contribute these to `master`.\r\n\r\nPlease feel free to comment on the PRs there.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4635832000/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]